<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/efo/releases/3.93.0/imports/merged/other-j.owl>

Declaration(Class(<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eastern_Asia>))
Declaration(Class(<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Japan>))
Declaration(Class(<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jordan>))
Declaration(Class(<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Western_Asia>))
